{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And he struck them and pursued them.</b> Rabbi Tanḥuma said: does a person pursue the slain? Rather, Abraham kills those whom the Holy One, blessed be He, pursues — <b>ויכם</b>, Abraham; <b>וירדפם</b>, the Holy One, blessed be He." "<b>Which are to the left of Damascus.</b> And there dwelt the members of Eliezer's family, as Onkelos translated regarding 'he is Damascus Eliezer,' and they aided Abraham for the sake of Eliezer."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:04:11.268377172Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}